OL,6,     FThe chilling story of a lodger
OL,7,     Ffrom Canterbury, Kent, who
OL,8,     Fmurdered his housemate and the
OL,9,     Fman's girlfriend after a row over
OL,10,     Fhot water.
OL,11,G2200 999: Critical Condition
OL,12,     FJohn has been stabbed and is
OL,13,     Frushed for emergency surgery. Teen
OL,14,     Ffootballer Adam has lost all
OL,15,     Fsensation below his waist, so
OL,16,     Fundergoes an MRI scan while his
OL,17,     Fparents wait anxiously.
