OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FDr Natalia Spierings needs a
OL,7,     Fcolleague's help after losing the
OL,8,     Flocation of a lipoma in patient
OL,9,     FPauline's abdomen. Dr Emma
OL,10,     FMcMullen tackles a very visible
OL,11,     Fcyst on patient Steve's face.
OL,12,G0000 Scam City: Don't Get Caught Out!
OL,13,     FConor Woodman goes deep undercover
OL,14,     Fin the world's most popular cities
OL,15,     Fto expose tourist scams. This
OL,16,     Fepisode explores New Orleans and
OL,17,     Fthe culturally bespoke scams
OL,18,     Funique to this city.
